1、新建模型权重文件夹DeepSeek-OCR

2、从modelscope上下载该模型到上述文件夹
modelscope download --model deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-OCR  --local_dir ./DeepSeek-OCR

3、创建虚拟环境dsr
conda create -n dsr python=3.12.7

4、嵌入到jupyter notebook环境中
python -m ipykernel install --user --name dsr --display-name "Python (dsr)"

5、进入虚拟环境，制作安装requirement.txt
transformers==4.46.3
tokenizers==0.20.3
PyMuPDF
img2pdf
einops
easydict
addict 
Pillow
numpy

6、安装pytorch
pip3 install torch torchvision --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu126

